      "registry": "reui.io base-nova. Measured against the repository at this commit: the served item is the file upstreamPath names with two things resolved into it - the import alias rewritten from @/registry/bases/base/lib/utils to @/lib/utils, and the per-style class markers (style-nova:, style-vega:, ...) collapsed to the nova style's own. So upstreamPath is a real path in that repository and the served bytes are that file composed with the style, not a copy of it.",
