      "tool": "shadcn@4.19.1, run against the @reui registry in a scratch copy of the template outside the repository. The template's own components.json names no registry: these six pieces travel as bytes with the entries below, and nothing is fetched at set-up, build or run time. Upstream ships TypeScript; tsx: false makes the tool rewrite it into the JSX these files are, so every vendored piece is a transform of the upstream file rather than a copy of it."
